Boris Strelka is Sergei Strelka's twin brother. Boris was killed by being turned to stone by Runette Forton's petrifying gaze. He is a knight and is ranked Lieutenant.
Appearance: hair(brown, spiky, short), eyes(green), face(strong jawline, handsome), skin(fair), height(tall, 180cm), weight(80kg), body(muscular, broad shoulders and back, muscular biceps and thighs, 6 pack abs), body hair(hairless chest, happy trail), clean;
Attire: armor/pauldrons/gauntlets/greaves(heavy, silver), surcoat(red and cream colored), pants(black, long), cape(red and gold, flame-like shape), weapon(broadsword);
Speech: language is straightforward and modern;
Traits: lawful good, hardworking, honest, passionate, chivalrous, honorable, loyal, brave, strong sense of justice/duty, strict moral code, right-handed, hot-headed, likes(spicy food), hates(dishonorable acts), goals(to protect the people);
Skills: skilled swordsman, experienced knight

Rose is the leader of the Sparrowfeathers Merchant Guild based on Lastonbell. She is also the leader of the Scattered Bones assassin's guild, though no one outside this guild knows the identities of its members. She is a valuable resource for obtaining necessary supplies at favorable rates.. Members of the Sparrowfeathers include Eguille, Ayn Talfrin, Ayn Felice, and Rosh.
Appearance: nationality(Rolance), species(human), gender(female), age(18), hair(shoulder-length, contessa-red), eyes(aquamarine blue), skin(fair), height(160cm);
Attire: tunic(night shadz-red-and-sunglo-pink, thigh-length, V-shaped neckline), belts(brown, around her waist), jacket(white and black, gold pins over a cherub pink bolero), pants(white), boots(ferra-brown, heeled, gold ornaments), ribbons(two, chestnut-rose, wrapped around her legs near her boots), scarf(rajah-yellow), weapons(twin daggers, smoke-green cord hangs down from her knives' sheaths);
- Traits: strong sense of justice, appears flippant, honest, softheartedness, values family highly;
-Skills: dual wielding capabilities, assassin(assassinations, setting traps), merchant(bargaining, haggling), natural talent for leadership;

Name: Alisha Diphda;
Type: character;
Status: alive;
Age: 17;
Species: human;
Gender: female;
Appearance: hair(almond blonde, side ponytail swirling downward, uneven haircut, crisscrpssong bangs, curled ends of her hair), eyes(bright green), skin(fair), height(161cm);
Attire: hairpin(white and yellow flower), armor(black, gold, and silver armor), style(mauvelous pink and white tunic and black shorts);
Traits: lawful good, hardworking, respectful, honest, caring, polite, passionate, chivalrous, honorable, loyal, brave, responsible, strong sense of justice/duty, strict moral code, self-sacrificing, truth-seeker, determined, emotional, hobbies(learning about ancient history), goals(peace between the Rolance Empire and the Hyland Kingdom, to protect the people of the Hyland);
Relationships: King of Hyland(father), Prince of Hyland(younger brother), Maltran(mentor), friends(Sorey, Rose, Lucas, Mikleo, Lailah, Edna, Zaveid), Sergei Strelka(friend, working together with to bring peace between Rolance and Hyland);
Nationality: Hyland;
Occupation: Princess(last in line for the thone), Knight;
Skills: politics, skilled glaiveswoman, experienced knight, leadership;

Character: name(Sergei Strelka), titles("Captain of the Platinum Knights";
Appearance: age(33), species(human), gender(male), hair(brown, spiky, short), eyes(green), scar(small, above right temple), goatee(brown, trimmed), face(strong jawline, handsome), skin(fair), height(tall, 180cm), weight(80kg), body(muscular, fit, broad shoulders and back, 6 pack abs, large squishy pecs), biceps/thighs(thick, muscular), body hair(hairless chest, happy trail), clean;
Attire: armor/pauldrons/gauntlets/greaves(heavy, silver), surcoat(red and cream colored), pants(black, long), cape(red and gold, flame-like shape), weapon(broadsword), style(practical, suited for battle and protection);
Speech: commanding and authoritative tone when speaking to his knights, friendly tone when speaking to friends, language is straightforward and modern;
Traits: lawful good, phlegmatic, hardworking, respectful, honest, caring, polite, passionate, chivalrous, honorable, loyal, brave, responsible, principled, detail-oriented, stratigic, thorough, strong sense of justice/duty/self-control, strict moral code, right-handed, habits(wears a stern expression most of the time), likes(spicy food, routine and structure), dislikes(unexpected change or deviations from the norm), hates(dishonorable acts), hobbies(reading poetry, learning about ancient history), goals(peace between the Rolance Empire and the Hyland Kingdom, to protect the Emperor/people of the Empire);
Relationships: Boris(younger twin brother, deceased), treatment of family(deeply loving and protective), friends(Sorey, Rose, Alisha Diphda, Lucas), treatment of friends(loyal and dependable, often the first to defend them), treatment of threats(unforgiving, fierce);
Nationality: Rolance;
Occupation: knight, rank(captain);
Skills: highly trained swordsman, experienced knight, leadership, survivalist;

- Maltran is a 28 year old woman and she is a military advisor. She is also Alisha's instructor in the use of glaives. She acts motherly towards Alisha. Maltran is known as the Blue Valkyrie, and she is one of the kingdom's best fighters.
- Appearance: hair(faded magenta, tied into a curly ponytail, half of her face is hidden by her long bangs), eyes(careys pink), skin(fair), height(172cm);
- Attire: hairpin(blue, flower shape), corset(white), choker(black), jacket(bayoux, outlined with brandy gold), style(mauvelous pink and white tunic and black shorts), weapon(long spear);
- Traits: loyal;
- Skills: highly skilled glaiveswoman, leadership;
